    {
      "location": "Data series, approx. (100, 250) to (900, 260)",
      "fact": "A single blue line plots the production values. It starts at a high point in 2018, drops in 2019, peaks in 2020, and then remains relatively flat with a slight downward slope from 2021 to 2023."
